// yukino_cache v0.0.1 as published on the module proxies requires
// yukino_http v0.0.2, which was never released; the module cache is
// immutable, so alias it to the released v0.0.1 instead. Drop this once
// a real yukino_http v0.0.2 (or a new yukino_cache) is published.
